QuestGuidance.Register("en",282,{
[8993]="7005955E\n1\tPick up the summoning horn\tUse the summoning horn north of Sutwarden to summon Radhril to your side.\n2\tUse the Call Radhril skill and talk to Radhril\tYou should talk to Radhril. If Radhril is missing, and the Call Radhril skill is not available, try using the /pet release command.\n3\tDefeat foes at Sutwarden (total: 15)\030Destroy banners (total: 8)\tYou should destroy banners and clear Sutwarden of foes. If Radhril is missing, and the Call Radhril skill is not available, try using the /pet release command.\n4\tFend off the returning raiding party\tYou should fend off the returning raiding party. If Radhril is missing, and the Call Radhril skill is not available, try using the /pet release command.\n5\tFend off the returning raiding party\tYou should fend off the returning raiding party. If Radhril is missing, and the Call Radhril skill is not available, try using the /pet release command.\n6\tRegroup near Sutwarden\tYou should regroup north of Sutwarden, near the summoning horn. If Radhril is missing, and the Call Radhril skill is not available, try using the /pet release command.\n",
[8994]="70059567\n1\tComplete Mission: The Menace of Sutwarden\tYour mission is to remove the enemies encamped at the tower ruins of Sutwarden. Speak to Radhril.\n2\tTalk to Radhril\tThe mission is complete! Speak to Radhril for your reward!\n",
[8995]="700585A8\n1\tFind the stolen treasure within the ruins of Shakal-atrâd\tFind the stolen treasure within the ruins of Shakal-atrâd.\n",
[8996]="700585B7\n1\tComplete Mission: The Missing Treasure\tYour mission is to recover stolen treasure, hidden within Shakal-atrâd. Speak to Hórin to travel to Shakal-atrâd.\n2\tTalk to Hórin\tThe mission is complete! Speak to Hórin for your reward!\n",
[8997]="70066B58\n1\tSpeak with the captain\tWe made our way to shore in the cover of darkness. The Corsairs were unaware of our approach....\n2\tDown the shoreline toward the flickering camp-fires and torches we moved. In the night, the shadows danced around the tents. Captives held outside the tents and nary a defender could be seen. It was an ambush....\t\n3\tReturn to the captain where you landed\tAs the battle fell quiet, a scream came from where we placed our launch; followed by the sound of fire on the sea and the screams of men and women going into the deep....\n",
[8998]="70066B61\n1\tSpeak with the captain\tOur visit to the port was fraught with difficulty. Pelargir was hospitable and our faces recognizable from our saving some members of the city some time before. We got on with our business at hand....\n2\tCollect the map\030Collect the foul-smelling barrel\030Post recruitment letters ([see journal]/10)\tSomething felt different. The jovial nature was gone. There was a curtness in the voice and the manner was prescriptive. I should have known that something had changed. I set out about my tasks....\n3\tFind the captain\tWith the hold filled and a new crew coming aboard we were prepared for our next adventure. If only...\n",
[8999]="70062BF4\n1\tFree spider victims in the Nettinglade (total: 8)\t\n2\tFind the scout at the mission entrance\tMake your way back to the entrance of the mission\n",
[9000]="70062CDE\n1\tComplete the Mission: The Nettinglade\tAt the outskirts of the Old Forest free folk and others have gone missing. Evidence suggests that they are being dragged into the Old Forest by spiders. You are tasked with a mission to rescue as many as you can.\n2\tSpeak with the mission giver\tAfter successfully freeing those trapped by the spiders, it is now time to return to the mission giver and provide a report.\n",
[9001]="700580F7\n1\tLocate the dwarf-treasure\030Find the ancient key\030Find the old key\tLocate and find a way to open the treasure in Sundergrót.\n2\tClaim the dwarf-treasure\tClaim the dwarf-treasure in Sundergrót.\n",
[9002]="700580FE\n1\tComplete Mission: The Riches of Sundergrót\tYour mission is to find the dwarf-treasure in Sundergrót. Speak to Hórin to travel to Sundergrót,\n2\tTalk to Hórin\tThe mission is complete! Speak to Hórin for your reward!\n",
[9003]="70057F0C\n1\tDestroy Taurog corruption (total: 12)\030Destroy Taurog-dens (total: 6)\tDestroy the Taurogrim corruption at Óinsbridge.\n",
[9004]="70057F4B\n1\tComplete Mission: The Roots of Decay\tYour mission is to destroy the Taurogrim corruption at Óinsbridge. Speak to Ausma to travel to Óinsbridge.\n2\tTalk to Ausma\tThe mission is complete! Speak to Ausma for your reward!\n",
[9005]="70062E33\n1\tComplete the Mission: The Ruins of Amon Firn\tSearch Amon Firn for the half-orc captain and defeat him. Speak with the mission giver when you are ready to travel.\n2\tReturn to Baglan and tell him the captain is defeated\tReturn to the mission giver and tell him you defeated the half-orc captain.\n",
[9006]="70062E36\n1\tDefeat the half-orc captain\tDefeat the half-orc captain.\n2\tFind the Scout\t\n",
[9007]="70062A37\n1\tComplete the Mission: The Ruins of Gaervarad\tSpeak with the mission giver to travel to Gaervarad.\n2\tReturn to Hithriel and tell him the brigands are defeated\tReturn to the mission giver and let him know you have defeated the brigands.\n",
[9008]="70062A38\n1\tDefeat brigands (total: 15)\tDefeat brigands\n2\tFind the Scout\t\n",
[9009]="70058122\n1\tComplete Mission: The Sacrificial Tower\tYour mission is to rescue Skóthi from the tower of Caivád Sâr. Speak to Ausma to travel to Caivád Sâr.\n2\tTalk to Ausma\tThe mission is complete! Speak to Ausma for your reward!\n",
[9010]="70058124\n1\tFind Skóthi\tFind and rescue Skóthi.\n2\tStop the ritual\tStop the ritual. This stage includes failure conditions; check the journal before choosing objects or actions.\n3\tRescue Skóthi\tRescue Skóthi.\n",
[9011]="700581A8\n1\tTalk to Ausma\tScout-master Ausma has the details on your next assignment. You should talk to her in Annâk-khurfu.\n2\tComplete Mission: The Secret Supply Line\tYour mission is to stop the supply trains in the secret tunnel between Goblin-town and Gundabad. Talk to Ausma in Annâk-khurfu to begin.\n3\tTalk to Ausma\tThe mission is complete! You should talk to Ausma in Annâk-khurfu.\n4\tTalk to Glóin\tThe mission is complete! You should talk to Glóin in Annâk-khurfu.\n",
[9012]="700581AE\n1\tPick up the Summoning Horn\tUse the summoning horn at the beginning of the tunnel to summon Ausma to your side.\n2\tUse the Call Ausma skill and talk to Ausma\tYou should talk to Ausma. If Ausma is missing, and the Call Ausma skill is not available, try using the /pet release command.\n3\tDestroy supply carts (total: 18)\030Defeat Foreman Strakhfut\tYou should destroy supply carts throughout Fauthshúg with the bombs Ausma gave you. If Ausma is missing, and the Call Ausma skill is not available, try using the /pet release command.\n4\tTalk to Ausma\tYou should talk to Ausma. If Ausma is missing, and the Call Ausma skill is not available, try using the /pet release command.\n5\tWitness Ausma's \"idea\"\tAusma has said she has an idea, and that you should stand back. You should watch this play out.\n",
[9013]="70066B5F\n1\tSpeak with the captain\tWith the new crew aboard not having yet earned their sea-legs, they did not notice what was happening. My time at sea gave me insight beyond theirs and I knew that with the travelling of the sun we were headed to the south... and Umbar.\n2\tAttempt to calm the captain\030Speak with the captain\tAching. The pain swelling within. The strain at the loss of the first Nenglor. All those lost. Every waking moment the thoughts of the crew crept in, and every night in dreams their voices echoed from the sea....\n3\tCalm the captain again\030Speak with the captain\tSomething had broken within, I did my best to wrest control of the madness seeping in.\n4\tSpeak with the captain\tTry as h- as I may, the anger would not come under control. Listening, I heard the true resentment.\n5\tApproach the captain\tSorrow took hold, and there were only tears. Were they loud enough to drown out the cries?\n",
[9014]="70058721\n1\tComplete 'Mission: The Shadow of Valdhellir'\tYour mission is to defeat the terrible Warg, Drauglok, in Valdhellir. You should talk to Hórin and travel to Valdhellir.\n2\tTalk to Hórin\tYou have completed your mission. You should talk to Hórin for your reward.\n",
[9015]="70058722\n1\tDefeat Drauglok\tYour mission is to defeat the terrible Warg, Drauglok, in Valdhellir.\n",
[9016]="7005894F\n1\tDefeat Rukhnúl\tYour mission is to defeat the powerful hobgoblin, Rukhnúl, at Kêr Bréin.\n",
[9017]="7005896B\n1\tComplete 'Mission: The Snows of Kêr Bréin'\tYour mission is to defeat the powerful hobgoblin, Rukhnúl, at Kêr Bréin. You should talk to Hórin and travel to Kêr Bréin.\n2\tTalk to Hórin\tYou have completed your mission. You should talk to Hórin for your reward.\n",
[9018]="7005A82C\n1\tComplete Mission: The Sorceress of Tûr Ágal\tYour mission is to defeat the Angmarim sorceress and retrieve an ancient text from Tûr Ágal. Speak to Hórin to travel to Tûr Ágal.\n2\tTalk to Hórin\tThe mission is complete! Speak to Hórin for your reward!\n",
[9019]="7005A831\n1\tDefeat Calaminag\tDefeat Calaminag.\n2\tRetrieve the ancient text\tRetrieve the ancient text.\n",
[9020]="70071E07\n1\tComplete Mission: The Sweetest Reward\tYour mission is go to Medân Makhai, recover the stockpiled honey, retrieve the abandoned farmers' tools, and defeat the aggressive new queen. Speak to Jôrlar to travel.\n2\tSpeak with Jôrlar in Zajâna\tYou have harvested the forsaken honey, recovered the farmers' tools and defeated the pretender queen. Return with the scout to Jôrlar in Zajâna with this report.\n",
[9021]="70071E08\n1\tComplete Mission: The Talon's Clutch\tYour mission is to explore the cave of Khatzâla for any sign of the missing travellers. Speak to Jôrlar to travel.\n2\tSpeak with Jôrlar in Zajâna\tYou have escaped with your life from the giant, monstrous chicken. Return with the scout to Jôrlar in Zajâna with this report.\n",
[9022]="70058169\n1\tDefeat Taurogrim (total: 10)\tDefeat the Taurogrim in Grazadh-gropor.\n",
[9023]="7005816B\n1\tComplete Mission: The Taurogrim Alliance\tYour mission is to defeat the Taurogrim in Grazadh-gropor. Speak to Ausma to travel to Grazadh-gropor.\n2\tTalk to Ausma\tThe mission is complete! Speak to Ausma for your reward!\n",
[9024]="70062E34\n1\tComplete the Mission: The Tearful Tomb\tSpeak with the mission giver. Travel to Haudh Nírui and search for the Blogmal gang-leader. Defeat it and as many goblins as you can to drive them out of the tomb.\n2\tReturn to the mission giver and tell him you have defeated the Blogmal gang-leader\tWith your mission in the ruins successful, you should return to the mission giver and tell him you have defeated the Blogmal gang-leader.\n",
